{"title":"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There exist <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> unique nonnegative integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019b333814a87ed800c6196bbcf9188536186c6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_1 &gt; n_2 &gt; \\cdots &gt; n_r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"147\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> unique integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/a/bea4d576937a04ec200b1037fc8ee33e8f744cb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/b/06bbc7241f9ea77cdfaf7654ca7f206c2f2c561f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\le k\\le r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" />) with each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/a/bea4d576937a04ec200b1037fc8ee33e8f744cb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/4/004a37661613b63882b9f43a64dca05fb1feb2d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$- 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" /> such that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/8/8583fcf8b5e36851cf3d1546038070e8b70e6061.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_13^{n_1} + a_23^{n_2} + \\cdots + a_r3^{n_r} = 2008.\\]\" width=\"276\" height=\"15\" />\nFind <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/e/1be19d734e93ed13c2241f41e11073651a4bf166.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_1 + n_2 + \\cdots + n_r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"141\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/b/2bbd89b366570525d613a24489b110e8c4c92f34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{2008}_{10} = \\overline{2202101}_{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"144\" height=\"17\" />. In other words,\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb8a140c5075181b078cc65d366822e75fdcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2008 = 2 \\cdot 3^{6} + 2 \\cdot 3^{5} + 2 \\cdot 3^3 + 1 \\cdot 3^2 + 1 \\cdot 3^0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"342\" height=\"16\" /></center>\n<p>In order to rewrite as a sum of perfect powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we can use the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/2/3c21c0860aab76f0c4e4809b99d7dd1378a91980.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\cdot 3^k = 3^{k+1} - 3^k$\" width=\"136\" height=\"15\" />:\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/d/56d57e927fd20bdcb3784e34c65cfb009d164747.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2008 = (3^7 - 3^6) + (3^6-3^5) + (3^4 - 3^3) + 3^2 + 3^0 = 3^7 - 3^5 + 3^4 - 3^3 + 3^2 + 3^0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"624\" height=\"19\" /></center>\n<p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96a4840a6c1af44d8ebc585ace553f79b803f38b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7+5+4+3+2+0 = \\boxed{021}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"229\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>Note&#160;: Solution by bounding is also possible, namely using the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/0/ab038f171533261b0ff7c5b927252b988a5fc4eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+3+3^2 + \\cdots + 3^{n} =\\frac{3^{n+1}-1}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"264\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/c/abc1744a459ad135efd3fd45fca7285cae133717.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2008$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> digits in base 3. Therefore, we can add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/d/18dab532340fc6861fbf5dbddff7e6f41c35f647.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1093=1111111_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"17\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/d/eeded1df98d84c5e0ec6a70edba48275e82ad701.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3101=11020212_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"143\" height=\"17\" />. Subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/b/19b61c8edede95c01cd2f35bb2525d04d9bec68f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1093$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> back from this, we find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/3/533e8cc05421f00e5e5c116377fe2a892ada83e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2008 = 1 0 (-1) 1 (-1) 1 0 1_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"199\" height=\"20\" />. We need to sum the exponents of the non-zero digits of this number, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/9/6b9d8eb18385be42b729714d5999c1ff1c47d40a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7+5+4+3+2+0=\\boxed{021}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"230\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II\" title=\"2008 AIME II\">2008 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2008\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</di